  "question": {
    "text": "A body is projected upwards with a velocity of <math><msup><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>11.2</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> from the surface of the earth. The velocity of the body when it escapes from the gravitational pull of earth will be"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><msup><mrow><mn>11.2</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
