  "solution": {
    "text": "The minimum velocity of projection to achieve escape velocity can be calculated as,<br /><br />Initial  <math><mi>KE</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>mv</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>.2</mo></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mi>mv</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></math><br /><br />As <math><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mi>mv</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi></math>&nbsp; energy is used up in coming out from the gravitational pull of the earth, so <br /><br />Final   <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi>KE</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi></math> should be <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mn>15</mn><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mi>mv</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></math><br /><br />Hence, &nbsp;<math ><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><msup><mfenced><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>'</mo></msup></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mi>mv</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∴</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>or</mi><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>15</mn></msqrt><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub></math><br /><br /><math ><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>15</mn></msqrt><mo>×</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>.2</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>km</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>"
  }
